      "summaries": {
        "en": "ModernBERT-base is an optimized BERT variant that addresses the computational inefficiency of traditional pre-training while maintaining strong performance. It introduces a novel 'modern' pre-training approach using shorter sequences and fewer steps, achieving comparable results with significantly reduced training costs. Developers can use it via Hugging Face for tasks like masked language modeling, benefiting from its efficient architecture for applications requiring robust language understanding without excessive resources.",
        "zh": "ModernBERT-base 是一种优化的 BERT 变体，旨在解决传统预训练计算效率低的问题，同时保持强大的性能。它采用创新的“现代”预训练方法，通过更短的序列和更少的训练步骤，显著降低了计算成本，而性能仍与标准模型相当。开发者可通过 Hugging Face 直接使用该模型进行掩码语言建模等任务，其高效架构特别适合需要稳健语言理解能力但资源有限的应用场景，为自然语言处理实践提供了实用的技术选择。",
        "es": "ModernBERT-base is an optimized BERT variant that addresses the computational inefficiency of traditional pre-training while maintaining strong performance. It introduces a novel 'modern' pre-training approach using shorter sequences and fewer steps, achieving comparable results with significantly reduced training costs. Developers can use it via Hugging Face for tasks like masked language modeling, benefiting from its efficient architecture for applications requiring robust language understanding without excessive resources.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ModernBERT-base stands out for transformers, pytorch, and onnx in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ModernBERT-base is an optimized BERT variant that addresses the computational inefficiency of traditional pre-training while maintaining strong performance. It introduces a novel 'modern' pre-training approach using shorter sequences and fewer steps, achieving comparable results with significantly reduced training costs. Developers can use it via Hugging Face for tasks like masked language modeling, benefiting from its efficient architecture for applications requiring robust language understanding without excessive resources.",
